  "remaining_integration_work": [
    "Implement the controller-owned process composition: create the dedicated broker, worker and guardian children; establish exact inherited-descriptor close sets; and consume the guardian-v2 authority bundle in the guardian child.",
    "Wire the listener handoff, broker adoption, worker privilege drop and final seal, READY verification, guardian arming, release and CONSUMED acknowledgement, parent reservation ledger, terminal kill and pidfd-based reap into one fixed order.",
    "Prove the trusted single-writer/no-extra-packet channel topology structurally rather than inferring it from socket metadata.",
    "Integrate the controller into the frozen full-size bootstrap, dispatcher and lifecycle closure, authenticate the successor source closure and run a separately authorized bounded Linux native qualification.",
    "Only after native qualification, re-run the unchanged host, input, resource and real-import admission gates."
  ],
